What are you doing this weekend? Say it in French 🇫🇷

• Tu fais quoi ? = What are you doing?
• le week-end = the weekend
• je me repose = I rest
• le cinéma = the cinema
• Bon week-end = Have a good weekend

💬 Your turn: Ce week-end, je ___ !

